(7677818, 1255407, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s a super slim slice for F8!  Ok, I stand corrected and I''m eating crow.  Pretty cool, and thanks for sharing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I too was surprised to see it was F8 but guess at the distance I took the shot from, that is how the physic works :)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: That''s a super slim slice for F8!  Ok, I stand corrected and I''m eating crow.  Pretty cool, and thanks for sharing.   I too was surprised to see it was F8 but guess at the distance I took the shot from, that is how the physic works :)', '2020-10-26 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
