(7716023, 1255243, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, this lovely picture seems underwater.  Shows the beauty of determination, amidst a choking, seemingly, onslaught.<br/>Rather to the point in this light shone on the Ukraine.  But it''s just nature, maybe aside from the forest fire smoke, not a human atrocity.<br/>Hope this isn''t archival, though a good candidate for such, because I can predict beforehand that this could very well turn out to be a favorite.<br/>It''s already been seen and attributed.<br/>Thanks for showing this image to us.</td>', 'Yes, this lovely picture seems underwater.  Shows the beauty of determination, amidst a choking, seemingly, onslaught.Rather to the point in this light shone on the Ukraine.  But it''s just nature, maybe aside from the forest fire smoke, not a human atrocity.Hope this isn''t archival, though a good candidate for such, because I can predict beforehand that this could very well turn out to be a favorite.It''s already been seen and attributed.Thanks for showing this image to us.', '2022-03-05 10:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
